      <tei:div type="notes">
        <tei:p>“Arise! let the souls of the Hebrews rejoice,” by Cordelia Moïse Cohen (1809-1869), appears under the subject “Feast of Dedication” as Hymn 194 in <tei:hi rend="italic">Hymns Written for the Use of Hebrew Congregations</tei:hi> (Penina Moïse et al., Ḳ.Ḳ. Beth Elohim, 1856), p. 189. It does not appear in the previous 1842 edition of the hymnal. –Aharon Varady</tei:p>
